  },
  {
    name: 'Enter your 2024 MAGI (optional)',
    text: 'Type your 2024 Modified Adjusted Gross Income to highlight your specific bracket and see your exact monthly Part B premium, Part D surcharge, and annual extra cost. Your MAGI is your IRS Form 1040 AGI plus tax-exempt interest.',
  },
