---

<ToolLayout
  title="IRMAA Brackets 2026: Complete Table & Finder | Seniors Audit"
  description="See the complete 2026 IRMAA bracket table instantly — all six income tiers for single and joint filers. Enter your income to highlight your exact tier and total monthly Medicare cost."
  faqs={faqs}
  howToSteps={howToSteps}
  datePublished="2026-09-20"
  dateModified="2026-09-20"
  agency="CMS"
  canonical={canonical}
  keywords="irmaa brackets 2026, 2026 irmaa brackets, medicare irmaa brackets 2026, irmaa brackets married jointly, irmaa surcharge 2026, medicare irmaa 2026 table, irmaa income thresholds 2026"
>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO SECTION
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="ib-hero">
    <div class="ib-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb navigation">
      <a href="/medicare/" class="ib-breadcrumb-link">Medicare</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true"> › </span>
      <a href="/tools/" class="ib-breadcrumb-link">Tools &amp; Calculators</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true"> › </span>
      <span>IRMAA Bracket Finder 2026</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="ib-h1">IRMAA Brackets 2026: Complete Reference Table</h1>
    <p class="ib-date">
      Last verified against CMS.gov and SSA.gov in {lastReviewed}.
      <span class="ib-distinct-note"> This is the quick-lookup bracket table — for a full personalized calculation, use the <a href="/tools/medicare-irmaa-calculator/">IRMAA Surcharge Calculator</a>.</span>
    </p>

    <!-- AEO Quick Answer Block -->
    <div class="ib-aeo-block" role="note" aria-label="Quick Answer">
      <p class="ib-aeo-label">Quick Answer — 2026 IRMAA Brackets</p>
      <p class="ib-aeo-text">
        In 2026, IRMAA surcharges apply when your <strong class="ib-gold">2024 MAGI</strong> exceeds
        <strong class="ib-gold">$109,000 (single)</strong> or <strong class="ib-gold">$218,000 (married filing jointly)</strong>.
        There are six tiers. The standard Part B premium is <strong class="ib-gold">$202.90/month</strong>.
        At the highest tier, the total Part B premium reaches <strong class="ib-gold">$689.90/month</strong>.
        IRMAA is a cliff — crossing a threshold by $1 triggers the full surcharge for the whole year, for each Medicare beneficiary separately.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Key context note: distinction from the calculator -->
    <div class="ib-context-strip">
      <div class="ib-context-item">
        <span class="ib-context-icon" aria-hidden="true">📋</span>
