      </div>
      <div class="ib-next-card">
        <p class="ib-next-title">Get a personalized IRMAA calculation</p>
        <p class="ib-next-desc">Enter your specific MAGI and filing status to see your exact surcharge breakdown for Part B and Part D.</p>
        <a href="/tools/medicare-irmaa-calculator/" class="ib-next-link">IRMAA Surcharge Calculator →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="ib-next-card">
        <p class="ib-next-title">Your income dropped — can you appeal?</p>
        <p class="ib-next-desc">If you retired, divorced, or had another qualifying event since 2024, you may be paying a surcharge based on income you no longer earn.</p>
        <a href="/tools/should-i-appeal-my-irmaa/" class="ib-next-link">Should I Appeal My IRMAA? Wizard →</a>
      </div>
